    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ぜひ、みのりさんにお願いしたいと、\n制汗剤のCMのオファーをいただきました。",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:1_5_011_02:cmd-000017:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02",
          "part_id": "1_5_011_02",
          "file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_011min/scenario_1_5_011_02.json",
          "command_index": 17,
          "field_kind": "dialogue",
          "field_ordinal": 0
        },
        "source_hash": "sha256:24d26062178f391c12a1e2a68ee481c3bc689854fdfb1c26090e5e70b1b2d259"
      },
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_5_011_02",
        "source_file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_011min/scenario_1_5_011_02.json",
        "command_start": 17,
        "command_end": 17
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "こちらが製品のサンプルと、\nCMの資料になります。",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:1_5_011_02:cmd-000021:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02",
          "part_id": "1_5_011_02",
          "file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_011min/scenario_1_5_011_02.json",
          "command_index": 21,
          "field_kind": "dialogue",
          "field_ordinal": 0
        },
        "source_hash": "sha256:56414210e1762ec2542c7137d387c5d1c1dce010d17e02b3e3d0205815c2972d"
      },
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_5_011_02",
        "source_file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_011min/scenario_1_5_011_02.json",
        "command_start": 21,
        "command_end": 21
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ありがとう。……へえ、制汗剤のフレグランスごとに\n演じる役の設定が変わるCMなのか。",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:1_5_011_02:cmd-000025:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02",
          "part_id": "1_5_011_02",
          "file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_011min/scenario_1_5_011_02.json",
          "command_index": 25,
          "field_kind": "dialogue",
          "field_ordinal": 0
        },
        "source_hash": "sha256:bb0d9d94bab9aa94dd0b9190f2c62a04792ebe8a27ee921c77621d06930d67fe"
      },
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "idol",
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_5_011_02",
        "source_file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_011min/scenario_1_5_011_02.json",
        "command_start": 25,
        "command_end": 25
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺が1人でいろんなアイドルを演じるような\nイメージが湧くね。衣装がそれっぽいからかな？",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:1_5_011_02:cmd-000029:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02",
          "part_id": "1_5_011_02",
          "file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_011min/scenario_1_5_011_02.json",
          "command_index": 29,
          "field_kind": "dialogue",
          "field_ordinal": 0
        },
        "source_hash": "sha256:29c6a7b36ea641eb1f4472ff18b648eb5e293afcf9a1222ea5203e3b9bbe4829"
      },
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "idol",
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_5_011_02",
        "source_file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_011min/scenario_1_5_011_02.json",
        "command_start": 29,
        "command_end": 29
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "例えばこれ、ミント系ならクールなアイドルって\nイメージだし、石鹸なら爽やかアイドルとか。",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:1_5_011_02:cmd-000033:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02",
          "part_id": "1_5_011_02",
          "file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_011min/scenario_1_5_011_02.json",
          "command_index": 33,
          "field_kind": "dialogue",
          "field_ordinal": 0
        },
        "source_hash": "sha256:8fdc9fe7a870c094dc3fbeaf56fb11a108ca4b010b4d73ed1c94b2267ad5021c"
      },
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "idol",
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 9
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_5_011_02",
        "source_file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_011min/scenario_1_5_011_02.json",
        "command_start": 33,
        "command_end": 33
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "何より今回の目玉の甘酸っぱいフルーツの\nフレーバーはまさに可愛いアイドル！",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_02:1_5_011_02:cmd-000037:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_011min_1_5_011_02",
